# Separate git repos checked out here, not part of this repo.
# openclaw/ is an upstream vendor checkout of openclaw/openclaw pinned at
# 2026.2.6-3. It was committed as a bare gitlink (mode 160000) with no
# .gitmodules entry, so every fresh clone got an empty, unresolvable
# openclaw/ directory. De-registered 2026-08-22; the working copy on Tower
# is untouched and upstream is recoverable with a normal clone.
nanoclaw/
openclaw/

# Served content, not source. Caddy mounts /Playground straight off this
# directory, but what lands here is BUILD OUTPUT published by
# nairn-book/bin/publish.sh — the book, the 22 spread JPEGs, the 113 MB of 4K
# print plates and the presenter's script. 71 MB, regenerable, and this repo is
# public while the book is a private family surprise. The source of record is
# Inlustra/nairn-book (private).
Playground/

